elves with stunning self-righteousness and marked determination -- especially if the National Guard gets involved.<br /><br />So, if we activate the network and in 20 minutes have 500 armed men surrounding a 20-man S.W.A.T team that has invaded a citizen&#39;s home, ARE YOU WILLING TO AIM YOUR GUNS AT THE S.W.A.T. TEAM?<br /><br />ARE YOU WILLING TO PULL THE TRIGGER, KILL SOME MEN, AND THEN LIVE WITH THE CONSEQUENCES?  (This would be exceedingly difficult for me as I have the utmost respect for police in general and would never want to make their children orphans.  Although, S.W.A.T. teams not so much ...)<br /><br />IN THE AFTERMATH OF SUCH EVENTS, ARE YOU THEN WILLING TO &quot;DOUBLE DOWN&quot; AND FIGHT THE MAJOR LIBERAL MEDIA&#39;S PROPAGANDA ONSLAUGHT WITH THEIR LIES, THEIR SLANDER, THEIR HALF-TRUTHS AND THEIR SINS-OF-OMISSION ALL AIMED AT MAKING YOU SEEM LESS LIKE PATRIOTIC, VIRTUOUS MINUTE MEN AND MORE LIKE HITLER&#39;S BROWNSHIRTS?<br /><br />WILL YOU BE PREPARED TO &quot;DOUBLE DOWN&quot; AND FACE A CAMPAIGN BY THE NATIONAL GUARD AND THE POLICE TO FIND AND ARREST EVERY MAN INVOLVED IN THE INITIAL ACT OF RESISTANCE -- WHICH WILL NECESSARILY MEAN WE&#39;LL HAVE TO ESCALATE OUR NUMBERS AND HOSTILITIES SUCH THAT THE GOV&#39;T SUES FOR PEACE?<br /><br />We can&#39;t START something if we&#39;re not prepared to FINISH it.  That means possibly missing weeks of work, living in hiding away from our families and homes, and who knows what else.   Are we all prepared to go where this will take us?  Are we really?<br /><br />If so, somebody who&#39;s smarter than I am needs to start devising a communications network and how it will work.  If we&#39;re not organized and effective, we&#39;re useless.<br /><br /><br />
